f the plan works, there is no surprise.\n\nTherefore, under the hypothetical condition that the plan succeeds, the professor would not be surprised.\n\n**Selecting the Answer:**\nThe professor would not be surprised if the intended action (students cracking cans at 9:17) successfully occurred.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{B}$
