woman said.**\n    *   The man does not repeat exactly what the woman said. He denies her accusations ("I am not drunk," "I am not fucking drunk"). This choice is factually incorrect.\n\n**Step 3: Conclusion.**\nChoice B provides the most accurate description of the man's behavior following the time question that aligns with the woman's accusation of drunkenness (evasiveness/denial instead of answering).\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{B}$
