\$12,000 - \$9,960 = \$2,040$.\n\nThis interpretation ($\$2,040$) aligns with option D.\n\n**Step 4: Compare the calculated fee with the options.**\nCalculated Fee (based on the most logical interpretation of the sequence of numbers provided): $\$2,040$.\nOptions:\nA) 4000\nB) 1500\nC) 3060\nD) 2040\n\nThe calculated fee matches option D.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{D}$
